      "reasons": [
        "The definition states the term “often appears when discussing problematic AAS use.” The packet only discusses developing/measuring “AAS dependence” and that there are “no measures available to assess AAS craving”; it does not support the claim about how/when the term “often appears” or that this is specifically framed as “problematic AAS use.”",
        "The claim that AAS use can be linked to “dependence and craving in some people” is only partially supported: the packet provides a dependence estimate (about 30%) but does not directly state that craving occurs in “some people,” only that measures for craving are currently unavailable and may be important alongside dependence."
